    "text": "rhsnews.co\nwebsite\nPortland\nFormer Cowlitz County resident detained for assaulting officer near Portland ICE office\nBy Allie Williams,\n22 hours agoA person with ties to Kelso was arrested for allegedly assaulting a federal officer outside a U.S. Immigration and Customs Enforcement building on Wednesday in Portland. According to a partially redacted federal affidavit, Samuel Tate Berry, 29, who previously lived in Kelso, Gearhart, and Seaside, was arrested for assaulting a Customs and Border Protection agent with a shield and resisting arrest by a Federal Protective Services inspector.\n1",
